{"ID":"20240515131354-rhj10dp","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131354-rhj10dp","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131354-rhj10dp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515142437-5bug967\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515142437-5bug967\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515142437-5bug967\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:369,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:369\u0026#125;","title":"091","type":"doc","updated":"20240515181622"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515142437-5bug967","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 750px;","id":"20240515142437-5bug967","updated":"20240515181622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/08/12"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MM"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"54 歲，略胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/8/12"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"體力差，一直餓，過胖，今年增重25磅。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 睡眠：好。胃口：好，喜甜食。大便：每日行。口渴尚好，喜温飲。雙足冷冰。不易流汗。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"稍數無力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃乾。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"眼診 ："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瞳孔對光無反應→腎陽不足。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 上熱下寒，腎陽不足致體力差。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石膏五兩　知母五錢　防己三錢　茯苓三錢　澤瀉四錢　炮附子三錢　細辛二錢　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃連二錢　黃芩三錢　補骨脂三錢　敗龜板二錢　生地二錢　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五付　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9—3碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解說： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"石膏五兩　知母五錢　防己三錢　茯苓三錢　澤瀉四錢→老師的秘密減肥方。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮附子三錢　補骨脂三錢→補腎陽。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生地二錢→補腎陰因舌苔黃，若苔白用熟地。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"敗龜板→陰陽俱補"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"澤瀉四錢→補腎時常用以利水。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃連味苦，入心以補心"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"倪師曰：若患者精神體力尚可補腎就用補骨脂、澤瀉、熟地即可。若體力不好，腎臟功能很差了，就要用敗龜板、補骨脂、炮附子來補腎。弱欲補腎精、增加男人的精子就要用菟絲子、覆盆子。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"熱藥冷服。"}]}]}]}]}